Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 10:33:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Support for firewall white list and black list.

[Description]:
 1. Introducing the Dynamic Datamodel for Firewall whitelist and
blacklist.
 2. Mapping DM parameter with syscfg params to presist accross reboot. 

Signed-off-by: Saravanan B <saravb@qti.qualcomm.com>
